###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Stated errors are Hessian and eigenvalue MAEs (e.g. 0.105 and 0.360 eV/A^2 for hi-100k; 0.075 and 0.20 eV/A^2 for hi-best; literature AlphaNet 0.415 and 3.887), which have no schema property; energy/force MAEs are figure-only (Fig. 2a). Free-energy MAEs and TS success rates are properties.
# - Dataset sizes of the xTB sets are approximate (about 9.6M and 1.7M); no n. The Hessian labels themselves are not a schema property.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/yin2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
